  "rationale": "Item 2: the constant `brand` lowers to a static `:root` custom property. Item 3: the `ink` token (a match over the enum cell `mode`) lowers to `:root[data-scrml-theme-mode=\"<V>\"]` blocks, so the one attribute write §65.6's reflection performs switches it. (The page stands in for the reflection by writing the attribute.)",
